title: GraphR1Dinner1
tags: graph
---
<<box R1Dinner1 "First dinner" goal="Be at her door at eight" entry=Route1Thu1Start>>
<<gate text "Read her text: eight, and the wine she drinks">>
<<clue wine "She drinks Red Fox" text>>
<<gate door "Knock on 3A" text R1MoveIn.shoes>>
<<gate peek "Glance at her notebook" door>>
<<clue notes "She writes about him" peek>>
<<gate dinner "Sit at her table: the dinner" door>>
<<gate dishes "Wash up: the dishes" dinner>>
<<exit bed "Go to bed" dishes to=R1Dinner2>>
===
title: GraphR1Dinner2
tags: graph
---
<<box R1Dinner2 "Second dinner" goal="“Bring what I'd want”" entry=Route1Thu2Start>>
<<gate text "Her text: “Bring what I'd want”">>
<<gate which "Which bottle?" detail="three Red Fox wines; her recycling bin shows the empty 2021" text R1Dinner1.wine>>
<<item fox "Red Fox 2021" which>>
<<gate find "Where are the socks?" detail="not in the drawer: on the drying rack" text R1MoveIn.ask>>
<<item socks "Blush socks, on" find>>
<<gate door "Get in the door" detail="knock with the wine; the socks on is what she really wanted" fox R1MoveIn.shoes>>
<<gate notebook "Open her notebook" door>>
<<clue pages "He's on four of her pages" notebook>>
<<gate sink "Find the corkscrew" detail="in her sink, under the cups" door>>
<<item corkscrew "Corkscrew" sink>>
<<gate open "Open the wine" corkscrew>>
<<gate dinner "Dinner" open>>
<<choice still "At her door" dinner>>
<<option still wait "Stand still">>
<<option still reach "Reach for her">>
<<gate night "Answer her night text" still=wait>>
<<exit knock "Go to bed" night to=R1Knock>>
<<exit retry "She closes the door" still=reach to=R1Dinner2Retry>>
===
title: GraphR1Dinner2Retry
tags: graph
---
<<box R1Dinner2Retry "Try again" kind=retry goal="“Tonight. Same time.”">>
<<gate text "Her text: “Tonight. Same time.”">>
<<choice still "At her door" text>>
<<option still wait "Stand still">>
<<option still reach "Reach for her">>
<<exit knock "Stood still" still=wait to=R1Knock>>
<<exit again "Reached again" still=reach to=R1Dinner2Retry>>
===
title: GraphR1Knock
