<<gate open "Open the door, as the rule says" late R1MoveIn.answer>>
<<gate wait "She tells him to wait" detail="the puzzle is to hold still" open>>
<<gate morning "Morning: “You're my boyfriend now. I decided.”" wait>>
<<exit on "Go to work" morning to=R1Free2>>
